tion_en\":\"\",\"key_parameter_1\":\"环境自适应感知: 利用热成像克服水面反光、雾气影响，自动过滤飞鸟干扰\",\"key_parameter_1_en\":\"Environmental Sensing: Uses thermal imaging to bypass water reflection and fog, filtering bird noise\",\"key_parameter_2\":\"精准反制策略: 结合AI算法锁定可疑目标，并实时实施大功率迫降反制\",\"key_parameter_2_en\":\"Precision Defense: AI-driven target locking with immediate high-power forced-landing neutralization\",\"parameters\":{\"探测手段\":\"中远距离侦测雷达 + 光电联动\",\"识别能力\":\"热成像+智能分析\",\"响应速度\":\"< 1s 自动预警\",\"环境适应\":\"抗雾、防水、防腐蚀设计\"},\"parameters_en\":\"{\\\"Detection\\\":\\\"Mid/Long-range radar + EO linkage\\\",\\\"Identification\\\":\\\"Thermal imaging + Smart analysis\\\",\\\"Response\\\":\\\"< 1s auto-alert\\\",\\\"Environment\\\":\\\"Anti-fog, waterproof, anti-corrosion\\\"}\",\"detail_html\":\"<h4>方案详解</h4><p>应对地形复杂、干扰物多的水环境问题，利用热成像克服水面反光与雾气。发现目标后系统工作绝不影响发电大坝内核心机房的正常运行。</p><ul><li>全天候大范围感知</li><li>智能过滤环境干扰（水雾、飞鸟）</li><li>与电网安防系统深度兼容</li></ul>\",\"detail_html_en\":\"<h4>Solution Details</h4><p>Addressing complex terrain and water environment issues, thermal imaging is used to overcome water reflections and fog. System operation after target detection never affects the normal operation of core computer rooms within the dam.</p><ul><li>24/7 wide-range perception</li><li>Intelligent filtering of environmental noise (mist, birds)</li><li>Deeply compatible with grid security systems</li></ul>\",\"main_image\":\"/solutions/infrastructure protection/Hydroelectric Dam Protection/Hydroelectric Dam Protectio.webp\",\"handle\":\"hydroelectric-dam-protection\",\"category_primary\":\"Infrastructure Protection (关键设施防护)\",\"recommended_products\":\"[\\\"stationary-rf-detection-system\\\",\\\"stationary-active-rf-defense-system\\\",\\\"uav-navigation-spoofing-system\\\",\\\"composite-electro-optical-tracking-system\\\",\\\"handheld-integrated-sdr-c-uas\\\",\\\"portable-anti-drone-jammer-shield\\\"]\",\"product_name_ru\":\"Защита гидроэлектрических плотин\",\"summary_ru\":\"Обеспечение безопасности тела плотины и