sified information and high-risk personnel management, facing hidden dangers such as illegal UAV intrusions for spying or contraband dropping. This solution constructs an all-round three-dimensional prevention and control system, coordinating the deployment of optoelectronic monitoring, UAV prevention, and intelligent security screening terminals to safeguard the core security of judicial premises.\",\"key_application\":\"Key Area Security (要地（公检法司/军队政府）安保)\",\"key_application_en\":\"Key Area Security (Judicial/Military/Government)\",\"key_parameter_1\":\"多维立体防御: 统筹部署监控、反制与安检，严防窃密、设施损毁与物品空投\",\"key_parameter_1_en\":\"Multi-dimensional Defense: Integrated monitoring, anti-UAV, and screening against spying and drops\",\"key_parameter_2\":\"全域全天候监测: 依托多光谱成像与智能识别技术，精准核实人、货、机目标\",\"key_parameter_2_en\":\"24/7 Monitoring: Multi-spectral imaging and smart ID for precision tracking of people, goods, and UAVs\",\"parameters\":{\"安防深度\":\"室内外一体化联动\",\"反击手段\":\"全波段屏蔽保护\",\"安检精度\":\"毫米波/X光多重检查\",\"预警响应\":\"< 2s 自动抓拍识别\"},\"parameters_en\":\"{\\\"Depth\\\":\\\"Outdoor-Indoor integrated linkage\\\",\\\"Countermeasure\\\":\\\"Full-band shielding protection\\\",\\\"Accuracy\\\":\\\"Multi-layered MMW/X-ray inspection\\\",\\\"Response\\\":\\\"< 2s auto-capture & recognition\\\"}\",\"detail_html\":\"<h4>司法安防立体防线</h4><p>针对收押、审讯等高度敏感区域，方案不仅防范外部无人机的“黑飞”干扰，同时也提升了物理卡口人员出入的数字化管控能力。</p><ul><li>阻断违规无人机信号，防范窃密</li><li>FC-H探测门实现涉密手机精准拦截</li><li>智能X光机快速查验入场物资</li></ul>\",\"detail_html_en\":\"<h4>Judicial Security Defense</h4><p>Focusing on highly sensitive areas like detention and interrogation rooms, this solution prevents 'black-flight' drone interference while enhancing digitized entry control at physical checkpoints.</p><ul><li>Blocking illegal UAV signals to prevent information leakage</li><li>FC-H detector for precise interception of classified phones</li><li>Smart X-ray machines for rapid inspection of incoming goods</li></ul>\",\"main_image\":\"/solutions/key area security/Judicial Secto